  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Your foe really does a number on your shoulder, his arrow piercing bone, nerves and blood vessels, finally punching out from your split and cracked shoulder blade.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Prone], @Condition[Stunned] (3) and @Condition[Bleeding] (2), the latter of which requires Surgery to remove. Also, the arm is permanently useless (see under @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.MnMZv7ZXoRqoH9dS]{Amputated Parts}).</p><p>Extraction will be <strong>Hard (-20)</strong>.</p>"
    },
